      "State in writing that home days carry no weight in reviews or promotion. Brief managers on this, and track promotion and rating outcomes for people who use their home days versus those who don't.",
      "Give managers a clear rule for exceptions, such as a minimum notice period and a cap on recalls, so the fixed Wednesday and Friday days can't be eroded team by team.",
